safix::unknown_subject

  × 'bo' is not a declared subject, so no membership may name it.
  │ 
  │ A subject is what can hold a key and appear in an audience: a person of
  │ flake.safix.users, a machine, a service, or another group. An organization
  │ is
  │ not one — a principal is not a member, and an audience wanting its custody
  │ names the organization.
  │ 
  │ A membership naming an undeclared subject is refused at the next
  │ evaluation,
  │ so nothing was written: an edit that wrote one would commit a tree that no
  │ longer resolves.
  │ 
  │ Declared subjects:
  │   - alice
  │   - bob
  │   - deck
